1174
00:01:58,817 --> 00:01:59,697
Uh, wha...

1175
00:01:59,697 --> 00:02:02,387
Come on, snap out of it and get ready for school!

1176
00:02:02,727 --> 00:02:04,997
And make sure you fix your hair!

1177
00:02:07,967 --> 00:02:11,987
Isn't there anything I can do about these cowlicks?

1178
00:02:11,987 --> 00:02:15,307
Anne usually makes my hair look nice for me...

1179
00:02:15,507 --> 00:02:18,617
Huh? Wait, who is this Anne again?

1180
00:02:21,797 --> 00:02:24,937
Is this what I've always looked like?

1181
00:02:26,327 --> 00:02:28,117
Oh, crap!

1182
00:02:31,017 --> 00:02:35,797
When are you going to learn to wake up 
without having your blanket dragged off of you?

1183
00:02:35,797 --> 00:02:37,947
Shouldn't you be at college, Onii-chan?

1184
00:02:37,947 --> 00:02:39,837
My classes start in the afternoon.

1185
00:02:39,837 --> 00:02:41,357
Here's your lunch.

1186
00:02:41,357 --> 00:02:42,667
Thanks!

1187
00:02:42,667 --> 00:02:44,447
Okay, now get going.

1188
00:02:44,447 --> 00:02:46,757
Right! See you later!

1189
00:02:46,827 --> 00:02:49,257
Wait! Why did you take <i>that</i>?!

1190
00:02:51,137 --> 00:02:54,577
If you have to eat on the run, 
at least take bread or something!

1191
00:02:54,577 --> 00:02:55,857
Have a good day.

1192
00:02:59,307 --> 00:03:01,147
Just barely safe!

1193
00:03:01,377 --> 00:03:03,377
Nope, unfortunately. You're out.

1194
00:03:08,567 --> 00:03:13,007
Someone in my class told me you 
got called out for coming in late.

1195
00:03:13,077 --> 00:03:16,007
Yeah, I was up a little too late last night.

1196
00:03:16,007 --> 00:03:17,727
I had trouble getting up this morning.

1197
00:03:17,727 --> 00:03:20,657
You were playing games all night again, weren't you?

1198
00:03:22,077 --> 00:03:25,337
You should try to manage your time better.

1199
00:03:25,337 --> 00:03:28,417
So, how far have you gotten in <i>Fortune Lover</i>?

1200
00:03:28,667 --> 00:03:32,107
I'm about to conquer the self-centered Prince Alan.

1201
00:03:32,107 --> 00:03:35,207
But I've been able to talk normally with him and enjoy it,

1202
00:03:35,207 --> 00:03:38,447
so he doesn't really seem that self-centered.

1203
00:03:38,627 --> 00:03:40,397
He's generally pretty nice.

1204
00:03:40,597 --> 00:03:41,857
Nice?

1205
00:03:41,857 --> 00:03:45,547
Wait... huh? What am I talking about?

1206
00:03:45,547 --> 00:03:47,467
Uh, never mind!

1207
00:03:47,467 --> 00:03:48,977
We should hurry up and eat!

1208
00:03:48,977 --> 00:03:51,627
I missed breakfast, so I'm really hungry.

1209
00:03:51,627 --> 00:03:53,867
You can have my rolled omelet, then.

1210
00:03:53,867 --> 00:03:57,807
Thanks, Acchan-sama! I'll eat it right now!

1211
00:03:59,517 --> 00:04:01,787
So good!

1212
00:04:08,327 --> 00:04:10,137
<i>The usual routine...</i>

1213
00:04:10,657 --> 00:04:12,977
<i>Every day is the same as always...</i>

1214
00:04:15,227 --> 00:04:19,007
<i>Yet for some reason, it all feels so nostalgic</i>

1215
00:04:19,517 --> 00:04:20,987
<i>and precious.</i>

1216
00:04:26,697 --> 00:04:27,967
<i>Still...</i>

1217
00:04:27,967 --> 00:04:32,997
<i>I feel as if I'm forgetting something important...</i>

1218
00:04:43,547 --> 00:04:46,117
She's been asleep for two whole days.

1219
00:04:46,117 --> 00:04:48,017
And we don't even know why!

1220
00:04:48,337 --> 00:04:52,037
This latest doctor is the most intelligent 
and advanced one in the country.

1221
00:04:52,407 --> 00:04:54,637
I'm sure he'll figure out what's going on.

1222
00:05:03,887 --> 00:05:06,217
Everyone, please come in.

1223
00:05:08,277 --> 00:05:09,537
What do you think?

1224
00:05:09,777 --> 00:05:13,187
Frankly, I have no idea what's causing this.

1225
00:05:13,567 --> 00:05:16,897
I've examined her all over, 
and nothing is physically wrong.

1226
00:05:16,897 --> 00:05:18,997
She may wake up at any moment,

1227
00:05:19,307 --> 00:05:22,107
or she may never wake up again.

1228
00:05:23,327 --> 00:05:24,737
Oh, no!

1229
00:05:27,147 --> 00:05:31,437
What will happen to her if she never wakes up?

1230
00:05:31,777 --> 00:05:34,847
If she just continues to sleep for the rest of her life,

1231
00:05:34,847 --> 00:05:38,807
I suppose she'll grow weaker and eventually die.

1232
00:05:38,807 --> 00:05:41,437
No! You can't be serious!

1233
00:05:41,437 --> 00:05:42,397
Keith-sama!

1234
00:06:01,517 --> 00:06:02,977
Catarina-sama...

1235
00:06:18,877 --> 00:06:22,807
<i>Catarina-sama, please... please...</i>

1236
00:06:22,807 --> 00:06:25,147
<i>Please don't leave me...</i>

1237
00:06:31,567 --> 00:06:32,737
Are you all right?

1238
00:06:34,787 --> 00:06:37,397
Yes... I'm sorry.

1239
00:06:37,397 --> 00:06:38,987
I'll go and do the cleaning.

1240
00:06:38,987 --> 00:06:40,337
Of course.

1241
00:06:40,337 --> 00:06:42,757
I'll keep an eye on Catarina.

1242
00:06:42,757 --> 00:06:44,017
Thank you.

1243
00:06:52,847 --> 00:06:54,017
Catarina...

1244
00:06:54,457 --> 00:06:59,007
Besides, this is just a scratch. 
It's nothing to worry about.

1245
00:06:59,517 --> 00:07:02,667
<i>When that strange little girl came into my life,</i>

1246
00:07:03,217 --> 00:07:05,727
<i>her bizarre behavior drew my interest.</i>

1247
00:07:05,727 --> 00:07:07,557
<i>And as I spent time with you,</i>

1248
00:07:07,557 --> 00:07:09,447
<i>the dull, gray world I had been living in</i>

1249
00:07:09,447 --> 00:07:11,277
<i>became filled with brilliant colors.</i>

1250
00:07:12,397 --> 00:07:14,227
<i>Before that, all I ever knew was boredom,</i>

1251
00:07:14,227 --> 00:07:16,987
<i>and everything felt tedious.</i>

1252
00:07:21,797 --> 00:07:25,757
<i>I knew nothing of happiness or pleasure,</i>

1253
00:07:25,757 --> 00:07:27,917
<i>and you taught all that to me.</i>

1254
00:07:33,267 --> 00:07:35,297
<i>Jealousy and loneliness, too.</i>

1255
00:07:35,297 --> 00:07:36,377
<i>Everything.</i>

1256
00:07:40,427 --> 00:07:43,017
<i>I knew danger was near,</i>

1257
00:07:43,017 --> 00:07:45,817
<i>and yet I couldn't protect you.</i>

1258
00:08:12,177 --> 00:08:14,597
<i>We're brother and sister now.</i>

1259
00:08:14,597 --> 00:08:16,507
You can call me "Sister."

1260
00:08:16,877 --> 00:08:19,257
<i>I remember it as if it was just yesterday.</i>

1261
00:08:19,727 --> 00:08:21,467
<i>I was called a monster,</i>

1262
00:08:21,707 --> 00:08:23,607
<i>sat huddled up in a dark room,</i>

1263
00:08:23,797 --> 00:08:25,607
<i>and lived my life all alone.</i>

1264
00:08:26,487 --> 00:08:28,557
<i>And then she smiled at me.</i>

1265
00:08:28,997 --> 00:08:30,267
<i>With her warm hand,</i>

1266
00:08:30,707 --> 00:08:33,857
<i>she led me into a much brighter world.</i>

1267
00:08:37,517 --> 00:08:39,317
<i>That was when I made a vow</i>

1268
00:08:40,027 --> 00:08:43,077
<i>to become stronger so that 
I could be the one to protect her.</i>

1269
00:08:46,297 --> 00:08:47,647
<i>And yet...</i>

1270
00:08:48,287 --> 00:08:51,777
<i>Why wasn't I by her side when she needed me?</i>

1271
00:08:58,837 --> 00:09:02,977
<i>Your green thumb makes you extra special 
and extra amazing, Mary!</i>

1272
00:09:03,347 --> 00:09:07,787
<i>I still clearly remember 
the day I met Catarina-sama.</i>

1273
00:09:08,227 --> 00:09:09,847
<i>I was a weakling and a coward,</i>

1274
00:09:09,847 --> 00:09:12,567
<i>always looking down, always running away.</i>

1275
00:09:12,567 --> 00:09:16,337
<i>But Catarina-sama said I was special...</i>

1276
00:09:16,337 --> 00:09:18,987
<i>that I was amazing.</i>

1277
00:09:19,397 --> 00:09:23,487
<i>I am who I am now because 
Catarina-sama was by my side.</i>

1278
00:09:23,487 --> 00:09:28,237
<i>Because she loved me 
and said I was important.</i>

1279
00:09:28,237 --> 00:09:32,047
<i>I hated myself, but she 
made me love who I was.</i>

1280
00:09:32,747 --> 00:09:35,167
<i>I want to continue to be with her forever.</i>

1281
00:09:36,277 --> 00:09:38,907
<i>With the one I love, 
who's so precious to me...</i>

1282
00:09:45,707 --> 00:09:48,607
<i>I'm sure you have some of each, as well.</i>

1283
00:09:48,607 --> 00:09:51,687
We all have things we handle well and things we don't.

1284
00:09:52,267 --> 00:09:54,537
<i>That's what she said to me when I was</i>

1285
00:09:54,537 --> 00:09:57,737
<i>sulking over being constantly 
compared to my twin brother.</i>

1286
00:09:57,737 --> 00:09:59,737
<i>She never held back when competing with me</i>

1287
00:09:59,737 --> 00:10:01,947
<i>and always faced me head-on.</i>

1288
00:10:01,947 --> 00:10:03,317
<i>After I met her,</i>

1289
00:10:03,317 --> 00:10:07,577
<i>I was finally able to loosen the excess 
tension I'd been putting on my shoulders.</i>

1290
00:10:12,887 --> 00:10:15,977
<i>Being next to someone as honest 
and straightforward as her</i>

1291
00:10:15,977 --> 00:10:17,807
<i>made me feel so comfortable.</i>

1292
00:10:18,457 --> 00:10:22,297
<i>So I stayed beside her, as if it was 
the most natural thing in the world.</i>

1293
00:10:23,527 --> 00:10:26,807
<i>I'm scared of losing her!</i>

1294
00:10:27,167 --> 00:10:29,007
<i>How could I be so oblivious?</i>

1295
00:10:29,297 --> 00:10:32,407
<i>Why did it take me until now 
to realize how I feel?!</i>

1296
00:10:40,207 --> 00:10:44,027
<i>With such lovely parents 
and such an adorable sister,</i>

1297
00:10:44,027 --> 00:10:47,247
you truly are blessed, Nicol-sama.

1298
00:10:47,677 --> 00:10:51,237
<i>People decided that a precious 
member of my family was a jinx,</i>

1299
00:10:51,237 --> 00:10:53,007
<i>and took pity on me.</i>

1300
00:10:53,237 --> 00:10:57,677
<i>No matter how many times I told them 
I was happy, no one understood.</i>

1301
00:10:58,087 --> 00:11:00,277
<i>I had decided that no one 
would ever understand,</i>

1302
00:11:00,757 --> 00:11:02,467
<i>that I should just give up.</i>

1303
00:11:03,377 --> 00:11:05,687
<i>But Catarina, and only Catarina, understood.</i>

1304
00:11:05,947 --> 00:11:08,487
<i>When anger and frustration flooded my heart,</i>

1305
00:11:08,487 --> 00:11:10,487
<i>she embraced it with her warmth.</i>

1306
00:11:11,067 --> 00:11:14,687
<i>From that day on, 
Catarina was someone special to me.</i>

1307
00:11:15,237 --> 00:11:18,117
<i>But she's engaged to my childhood 
friend, the third prince.</i>

1308
00:11:18,597 --> 00:11:22,807
<i>I know I can't be with her forever, 
no matter how I feel about her.</i>

1309
00:11:22,807 --> 00:11:26,077
<i>But still, I wanted to stay close 
to her as long as possible.</i>

1310
00:11:27,307 --> 00:11:30,407
Don't go anywhere, Catarina.

1311
00:11:35,937 --> 00:11:39,327
<i>Your white hair is as beautiful as silk,</i>

1312
00:11:39,327 --> 00:11:42,177
and your red eyes twinkle like rubies.

1313
00:11:42,177 --> 00:11:44,047
I think they're both beautiful!

1314
00:11:44,317 --> 00:11:45,777
<i>For my whole life,</i>

1315
00:11:45,777 --> 00:11:49,397
<i>people called me "creepy" 
and "cursed" because of my looks.</i>

1316
00:11:49,397 --> 00:11:52,017
<i>But Catarina-sama said I was pretty</i>

1317
00:11:52,017 --> 00:11:54,307
<i>and asked me to be her friend.</i>

1318
00:11:54,307 --> 00:11:56,437
<i>She was the first friend I ever had.</i>

1319
00:11:56,677 --> 00:11:58,397
<i>Her smile was so kind...</i>

1320
00:11:59,527 --> 00:12:01,927
<i>My life then changed in a tremendous way.</i>

1321
00:12:04,737 --> 00:12:07,567
<i>I left the room I had 
spent my life locked away in</i>

1322
00:12:07,567 --> 00:12:09,767
<i>and stepped into the bright sun.</i>

1323
00:12:09,767 --> 00:12:12,417
<i>I thought being so happy 
every day was like a dream</i>

1324
00:12:12,417 --> 00:12:14,747
<i>that only ever happened in books,</i>

1325
00:12:14,747 --> 00:12:16,477
<i>but then I was living it.</i>

1326
00:12:17,867 --> 00:12:19,197
<i>But now...</i>

1327
00:12:20,347 --> 00:12:22,707
Catarina-sama, I don't want to lose you!

1328
00:12:22,707 --> 00:12:25,097
I couldn't bear that!

1329
00:12:25,097 --> 00:12:28,407
<i>That's right! I refuse to lose her again!</i>

1330
00:12:35,007 --> 00:12:36,127
Who was that?

1331
00:12:37,877 --> 00:12:40,037
<i>I finally managed to find her!</i>

1332
00:12:40,037 --> 00:12:41,807
<i>I won't lose her again!</i>

1333
00:12:42,837 --> 00:12:44,487
That voice...

1334
00:12:51,397 --> 00:12:53,917
<i>I'm going to save her this time.</i>

1335
00:12:54,027 --> 00:12:56,697
<i>So don't just sit around in here crying.</i>

1336
00:12:56,697 --> 00:12:59,247
<i>You have to take me to her!</i>

1337
00:13:09,827 --> 00:13:13,597
I am Catarina-sama's best friend, Mary Hunt!

1338
00:13:13,717 --> 00:13:16,837
I'm not a weakling like those other noble ladies!

1339
00:13:18,837 --> 00:13:21,407
What am I doing, sitting around in here?

1340
00:13:22,207 --> 00:13:24,697
I have to save my sister!

1341
00:13:24,867 --> 00:13:27,277
She saved me.

1342
00:13:27,277 --> 00:13:28,617
Now it's my turn.

1343
00:13:37,577 --> 00:13:38,887
Sophia-sama?

1344
00:13:39,577 --> 00:13:43,077
I want to stay with Catarina-sama 
until she awakens!

1345
00:13:43,287 --> 00:13:44,837
I'm staying with my sister, too!

1346
00:13:45,127 --> 00:13:47,717
I won't leave Catarina-sama's side, either!

1347
00:13:48,067 --> 00:13:49,077
Me, neither.

1348
00:13:49,077 --> 00:13:51,517
I'll keep talking to her until she wakes up!

1349
00:13:54,067 --> 00:13:55,117
Everyone...

1350
00:13:59,567 --> 00:14:01,927
<i>Please, I beg you...</i>

1351
00:14:01,927 --> 00:14:03,897
<i>Save Catarina-sama.</i>

1352
00:14:04,207 --> 00:14:07,417
<i>I'm on it! I'll bring her back, I promise!</i>

1353
00:14:07,417 --> 00:14:10,157
<i>All of you, just stay there and keep calling to her!</i>

1354
00:14:38,267 --> 00:14:40,767
Acchan, I'm finally here!

1355
00:14:42,697 --> 00:14:43,877
Yes.

1356
00:14:47,507 --> 00:14:51,167
I'm working on conquering the 
black-hearted, sadistic prince now.

1357
00:14:51,167 --> 00:14:54,047
I can't seem to make any 
progress with him, though.

1358
00:14:54,047 --> 00:14:55,327
I see.

1359
00:14:56,887 --> 00:14:59,917
So... how's school going? 
Are you having fun?

1360
00:15:00,077 --> 00:15:01,637
Huh? Yeah.

1361
00:15:01,967 --> 00:15:04,497
What brought that on, anyway?

1362
00:15:09,397 --> 00:15:11,687
I'm having a lot of fun.

1363
00:15:12,827 --> 00:15:16,897
I'm glad I was able to find you again 
and spend time with you.

1364
00:15:18,077 --> 00:15:19,447
But the thing is...

1365
00:15:19,957 --> 00:15:22,567
This isn't your world anymore, is it?

1366
00:15:23,407 --> 00:15:24,567
Acchan?

1367
00:15:25,337 --> 00:15:28,097
Your world is somewhere else now.

1368
00:15:28,667 --> 00:15:32,067
There are a lot of people waiting for you there.

1369
00:15:32,547 --> 00:15:35,837
Listen. They're all calling for you.

1370
00:15:37,357 --> 00:15:39,457
<i>Catarina! Catarina!</i>

1371
00:15:39,757 --> 00:15:40,997
Please wake up!

1372
00:15:40,997 --> 00:15:44,207
I can't even imagine life without you anymore!

1373
00:15:44,297 --> 00:15:45,977
Wake up, Sister!

1374
00:15:45,977 --> 00:15:48,667
Didn't you promise you'd always be with me?!

1375
00:15:48,667 --> 00:15:53,007
Catarina-sama, I can't do my best 
at anything without you!

1376
00:15:53,117 --> 00:15:54,927
Are you just gonna sleep forever?!

1377
00:15:54,927 --> 00:15:56,837
Wake up already, you dumb rich girl!

1378
00:15:57,137 --> 00:15:58,927
Wake up, Catarina!

1379
00:15:59,017 --> 00:16:01,517
Please open your eyes, Catarina-sama!

1380
00:16:01,607 --> 00:16:04,577
Please wake up, Catarina-sama!

1381
00:16:09,267 --> 00:16:13,367
Why... did I forget?

1382
00:16:14,577 --> 00:16:18,007
<i>My family can be annoying, 
but they're so kind.</i>

1383
00:16:18,317 --> 00:16:21,857
<i>I have a close otaku friend 
and a beloved otome game...</i>

1384
00:16:21,857 --> 00:16:24,827
<i>This world feels comfortable to be in.</i>

1385
00:16:25,207 --> 00:16:26,077
<i>But...</i>

1386
00:16:26,697 --> 00:16:28,607
I have to go back!

1387
00:16:28,607 --> 00:16:31,547
To the world where all 
the people I love are waiting for me!

1388
00:16:52,207 --> 00:16:53,837
That's it! Acchan!

1389
00:16:53,837 --> 00:16:56,407
I bet you know where Maria is, right?

1390
00:16:56,807 --> 00:16:59,007
Maria is on the school grounds.

1391
00:16:59,007 --> 00:17:01,407
There's a hidden room in the school storehouse.

1392
00:17:01,677 --> 00:17:04,307
Also, why did the student 
council president—

1393
00:17:08,037 --> 00:17:10,577
I know you can fix this.

1394
00:17:10,577 --> 00:17:15,037
Save the president, 
just like you saved all of us.

1395
00:17:15,557 --> 00:17:17,177
His real name is...

1396
00:17:21,067 --> 00:17:22,357
Acchan!

1397
00:17:22,357 --> 00:17:25,727
<i>This is probably the last time I'll ever see Acchan.</i>

1398
00:17:26,127 --> 00:17:28,787
<i>My best friend ever since middle school...</i>

1399
00:17:29,097 --> 00:17:31,487
<i>She's helped me out so much</i>

1400
00:17:31,917 --> 00:17:33,497
<i>but because of that accident,</i>

1401
00:17:33,497 --> 00:17:36,267
<i>I didn't have a chance 
to thank her or say goodbye.</i>

1402
00:17:36,817 --> 00:17:40,627
Acchan! I'm so glad I got to see you again!

1403
00:17:40,947 --> 00:17:42,187
Goodbye!

1404
00:17:42,187 --> 00:17:44,157
Thank you so much for always being there!

1405
00:17:53,637 --> 00:17:55,847
I was truly happy, too.

1406
00:17:56,607 --> 00:17:58,507
This time, I'll always be by your side...

1407
00:17:58,507 --> 00:18:00,247
as Sophia.

1408
00:18:01,637 --> 00:18:05,367
Goodbye, and thank you,

1409
00:18:05,367 --> 00:18:07,517
my precious best friend.

1410
00:18:15,967 --> 00:18:18,017
Don't cry, Sophia.

1411
00:18:19,937 --> 00:18:20,987
Good morning.

1412
00:18:24,807 --> 00:18:27,707
Welcome back, Catarina-sama!

1413
00:18:27,707 --> 00:18:29,407
Catarina-sama!

1414
00:18:29,407 --> 00:18:31,917
I was so, so worried about you!

1415
00:18:35,747 --> 00:18:38,097
<i>This is my world.</i>

1416
00:18:38,097 --> 00:18:41,707
<i>I want to protect this world 
and the people I care about.</i>

1417
00:18:41,887 --> 00:18:44,047
<i>I won't let that bad ending happen!</i>

1418
00:18:44,487 --> 00:18:46,727
I'm going to save Maria!

1419
00:18:46,727 --> 00:18:47,647
Huh?

1420
00:18:47,647 --> 00:18:51,307
Catarina, we still don't know where she's gone.

1421
00:18:51,307 --> 00:18:53,647
She's on the school grounds,

1422
00:18:53,647 --> 00:18:55,357
in a hidden room in the storehouse.

1423
00:18:56,397 --> 00:18:57,997
What are you talking about, sis?

1424
00:18:57,997 --> 00:18:59,937
How do you know where she is?

1425
00:18:59,937 --> 00:19:02,407
Oh, uh...

1426
00:19:02,877 --> 00:19:04,317
It came to me in a dream!

1427
00:19:04,517 --> 00:19:05,717
Huh?

1428
00:19:07,687 --> 00:19:10,957
The student council president 
was the one who cast the sleep spell on me.

1429
00:19:11,397 --> 00:19:12,907
He took Maria away, too.

1430
00:19:12,907 --> 00:19:15,727
Sirius Dieke? It was him?

1431
00:19:15,867 --> 00:19:17,417
Why would Sirius do that?

1432
00:19:17,807 --> 00:19:19,977
He's where Maria is.

1433
00:19:19,977 --> 00:19:21,407
Maria is safe.

1434
00:19:21,407 --> 00:19:23,407
Did that come to you in a dream, too?

1435
00:19:23,407 --> 00:19:24,557
No.

1436
00:19:25,447 --> 00:19:27,137
It's my intuition!

1437
00:19:31,937 --> 00:19:35,937
I can't believe the president has magic 
that can manipulate people.

1438
00:19:35,937 --> 00:19:39,777
I thought he was such a kind person... Why?

1439
00:19:39,777 --> 00:19:42,527
I'm honestly not sure, either.

1440
00:19:44,587 --> 00:19:45,617
That's it.

1441
00:19:46,077 --> 00:19:48,157
The Dieke family built the storehouse,

1442
00:19:48,157 --> 00:19:50,377
but it's supposed to be essentially unused now.

1443
00:19:57,317 --> 00:19:59,067
There really is a hidden room...

1444
00:20:02,457 --> 00:20:03,567
Maria!

1445
00:20:03,567 --> 00:20:06,067
Catarina-sama... and everyone!

1446
00:20:08,807 --> 00:20:11,277
I'm sorry we took so long, Maria!

1447
00:20:11,277 --> 00:20:16,127
I should apologize for putting 
you all through so much trouble.

1448
00:20:16,127 --> 00:20:19,687
No, don't apologize. 
I know you did it for my sake.

1449
00:20:19,787 --> 00:20:21,307
Thank you, Maria.

1450
00:20:21,917 --> 00:20:24,857
So... what about the president? 
Is he still here?

1451
00:20:25,077 --> 00:20:26,337
Yes.

1452
00:20:26,337 --> 00:20:30,367
Are you already aware of what he's done?

1453
00:20:30,757 --> 00:20:32,387
I know the gist of it,

1454
00:20:32,387 --> 00:20:35,197
but there's lot I don't understand about it.

1455
00:20:35,197 --> 00:20:38,117
That's why I want to talk to him one more time.

1456
00:20:48,617 --> 00:20:50,567
You know, the tea you make...

1457
00:20:50,567 --> 00:20:52,427
has a very gentle flavor.

1458
00:20:53,007 --> 00:20:57,097
The tea you make has such a gentle flavor.

1459
00:20:58,817 --> 00:21:00,447
<i>I sense a human presence.</i>

1460
00:21:00,797 --> 00:21:03,467
<i>You must not be caught here!</i>

1461
00:21:03,467 --> 00:21:05,067
It's over.

1462
00:21:05,067 --> 00:21:06,827
The moment of my doom has come!

1463
00:21:06,977 --> 00:21:08,177
<i>Not yet!</i>

1464
00:21:08,177 --> 00:21:10,037
<i>You have not completed your revenge yet!</i>

1465
00:21:10,377 --> 00:21:13,067
<i>Have you forgotten the last 
words your mother said to you?!</i>

1466
00:21:14,197 --> 00:21:16,367
Mom! Mom!

1467
00:21:16,647 --> 00:21:19,917
Please... avenge me.

1468
00:21:20,797 --> 00:21:22,427
<i>Eliminate them all...</i>

1469
00:21:22,427 --> 00:21:24,437
<i>using your dark magic.</i>

1470
00:21:24,437 --> 00:21:26,877
No! If I do that...

1471
00:21:39,557 --> 00:21:41,287
Are you okay, Maria?

1472
00:21:41,287 --> 00:21:44,107
Yes... I sense incredible power.

1473
00:21:58,717 --> 00:22:00,427
Sirius Dieke!

1474
